_per_sentence: 分句的最大token数，越小，推理速度越快，占用内存更多，可能影响质量\nsentences_bucket_max_size: 分句分桶的最大容量，越大，推理速度越快，占用内存更多，可能影响质量\nfast_inference: 开启快速推理\ncustom_cuda_kernel: 开启自定义 CUDA 内核, 第一次运行将自动构建 CUDA 内核扩展\ndialogue_audio_s2: 双人会话时的第二个音频, 如果输入这个音频, 自动启动会话模式. 会话模式下, 输入文本必须如下([S1] 表示第一个说话者, [S2] 表示第二个说话者):\n\n[S1] 轻喘像风掠过耳畔，\n[S2] 你靠近时，连呼吸都慢了半拍。\n[S1] 指尖在我锁骨上游移，\n[S2] 仿佛试探一扇未曾开启的门。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [525.5711059570312, 649.3900146484375], "pos": [2575.87158203125, 1586.0863037109375], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [525.5711059570312, 649.3900146484375], "pos": [1964.4732666015625, 966.6840209960938], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [34], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [30, 0.8, 0.8, 3, 1500, 120, false, false, true, 0, "[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0.2]", false, "", false, 1, "[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]", false, "", false], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 39, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"name": "text", "link": 36, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "dialogue_audio_s2", "label": "dialogue_audio_s2", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "dialogue_audio_s2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "emo_audio_prompt", "label": "emo_audio_prompt", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "emo_audio_prompt"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "emo_audio_prompt_s2", "label": "emo_audio_prompt_s2", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "emo_audio_prompt_s2"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", "label": "top_k", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "top_k"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localize